From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Paslawski <chris@paslawski.me>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 21:40:34 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] thermal: report AIDL events with correct sampling and Looper ownership

Deliver temperature changes through the AIDL callback path, and give sampling and Looper objects explicit lifetimes. Prevent stale callbacks, sampling regressions and teardown races; include native regression coverage.

Origin: Local ThinkSmart View port
Source: https://github.com/LineageOS/android_hardware_linaro_libpm
Base-commit: d062161c81d3d2b61b27425c2e39c728eab7f9f0
Apply in filename order within this project.

